    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC ayarlar\u0131 korunsun mu? Onaylamazsan 15 saniye
      sonra eski ayarlara d\xF6n\xFCl\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535397
    m_Localized: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCk "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535398
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC ayarlar\u0131 korunsun mu? Onaylamazsan 15 saniye
      sonra eski ayarlara d\xF6n\xFCl\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535399
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC boyutu konsoluna g\xF6re belirlenir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535400
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC de\u011Fi\u015Fikliklerini uygula"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535401
    m_Localized: ' Kontroller'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535402
    m_Localized: "Bir tu\u015Fa bas. Esc iptal eder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535403
    m_Localized: "Atamas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in bir kontrol se\xE7.
      Her tu\u015Fa yaln\u0131zca bir eylem atanabilir. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535404
    m_Localized: "Atamas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in bir kontrol se\xE7.
      Her tu\u015Fa yaln\u0131zca bir eylem atanabilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535405
    m_Localized: "Kamera Y eksenini ters \xE7evir "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535406
    m_Localized: "Dikey kamera hareketini tersine \xE7evirir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535407
    m_Localized: Kamera hassasiyeti
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535408
    m_Localized: Metin / HUD boyutu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535409
    m_Localized: "Azalt\u0131lm\u0131\u015F hareket "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535410
    m_Localized: "Daha rahat oynamak i\xE7in kamera ve men\xFC hareketlerini azalt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535411
    m_Localized: 'Gerilim simgeleri '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535412
    m_Localized: "Halat gerginli\u011Fini renklerin yan\u0131nda simgelerle de g\xF6ster."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535413
    m_Localized: "E\u011Fitim ipu\xE7lar\u0131 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535414
    m_Localized: "Duruma g\xF6re ipu\xE7lar\u0131 g\xF6sterir. Hedefler ve halat
      uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr kal\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535415
    m_Localized: "Kontrolc\xFC titre\u015Fimi "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535416
    m_Localized: "Halat, vin\xE7, \xE7arp\u0131\u015Fmalar ve kurtarmalar i\xE7in
      hafif geri bildirim. \u0130stedi\u011Fin zaman kapatabilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535417
    m_Localized: "Titre\u015Fim \u015Fiddeti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535418
    m_Localized: "Nas\u0131l oynan\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535419
    m_Localized: "S\xFCr\xFC\u015F, halat ba\u011Flama, vin\xE7 kullan\u0131m\u0131
      ve teslimat\u0131 dene. Kariyerin etkilenmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535420
    m_Localized: "\u0130lerlemeyi s\u0131f\u0131rla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535421
    m_Localized: "T\xFCm ilerleme s\u0131f\u0131rlans\u0131n m\u0131? Krediler, ara\xE7lar,
      ekipman ve kay\u0131tl\u0131 d\xFCzenler silinir. Tercihler korunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535422
    m_Localized: "T\xFCm ilerleme s\u0131f\u0131rlans\u0131n m\u0131? Krediler, ara\xE7lar,
      ekipman ve kay\u0131tl\u0131 d\xFCzenler silinir. Tercihler korunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535423
    m_Localized: "\u0130lerlemeyi s\u0131f\u0131rlamadan \xF6nce oturumdan ayr\u0131l."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535424
    m_Localized: "Sekmeyi varsay\u0131lana d\xF6nd\xFCr"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535425
    m_Localized: "Varsay\u0131lanlar\u0131 geri y\xFCkle "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535426
    m_Localized: " Bu sekmenin varsay\u0131lan ayarlar\u0131 geri y\xFCklensin mi?
      Kariyer ilerlemesi korunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535427
    m_Localized: "Varsay\u0131lanlar\u0131 geri y\xFCkle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535428
    m_Localized: "\xD6nceki sekme"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535429
    m_Localized: Sonraki sekme
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535430
    m_Localized: TOW TROUBLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535431
    m_Localized: "Bu ayarlar\u0131 daha sonra de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535432
    m_Localized: "Rahat\u0131na g\xF6re ayarla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535433
    m_Localized: "Bu ayarlar\u0131 daha sonra de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535434
    m_Localized: "\u0130lk arac\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535435
    m_Localized: "Ses d\xFCzeylerini ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 ayarla. G\xF6rsel uyar\u0131lar
      g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr kal\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535436
    m_Localized: "Grafikler bu konsola g\xF6re otomatik ayarlan\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535437
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC ayarlar\u0131 korunsun mu? Onaylamazsan 15 saniye
      sonra eski ayarlara d\xF6n\xFCl\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535438
    m_Localized: "Kontrollerini g\xF6rmek i\xE7in bir oyun kumandas\u0131 ba\u011Fla.
      Klavye ve fareyi kullanmaya devam edebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535439
    m_Localized: "Atamas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in bir kontrol se\xE7.
      Her tu\u015Fa yaln\u0131zca bir eylem atanabilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535440
    m_Localized: "Yaz\u0131 boyutu ve kamera hassasiyeti istedi\u011Fin zaman de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilebilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535441
    m_Localized: "\u0130pu\xE7lar\u0131 \xF6\u011Frenmeyi kolayla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r.
      \u0130lerlemeyi S\u0131f\u0131rla kariyeri siler ve tercihleri korur."
