    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715795
    m_Localized: "Sat\u0131n al ve tak"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715796
    m_Localized: "E\u011Fitim tamamland\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715797
    m_Localized: "Ba\u015Flat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715798
    m_Localized: "Kilidi a\xE7\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715799
    m_Localized: Kilitli
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715800
    m_Localized: Ekip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715801
    m_Localized: Ev sahibi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3520848715802
    m_Localized: "Kat\u0131l"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490410
    m_Localized: "Bir kurtarma se\xE7, arac\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rla ve otomobili
      teslim noktas\u0131na g\xF6t\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490411
    m_Localized: "Yava\u015F s\xFCr. Dengeli \xE7ek ve halata ani y\xFCk bindirme."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490412
    m_Localized: "Otomobili kurtarmadan \xF6nce devrilen a\u011Fac\u0131 kald\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490413
    m_Localized: "Arac\u0131 kurtarmak i\xE7in sa\u011Flam zemini ve vinci kullan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490414
    m_Localized: "Kurtar\u0131lan otomobili i\u015Faretli teslim noktas\u0131na \xE7ek
      ve alan\u0131n i\xE7inde dur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490415
    m_Localized: "Sat\u0131n almadan \xF6nce par\xE7alar\u0131 dene. Sahip oldu\u011Fun
      par\xE7alar\u0131 \xFCcretsiz takabilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490416
    m_Localized: "Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 ara\xE7lar\u0131ndan birini \xFCcretsiz
      se\xE7. Di\u011Fer ara\xE7lar\u0131 daha sonra at\xF6lyeden sat\u0131n al."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490417
    m_Localized: Ses ve kontrol tercihleri otomatik kaydedilir.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490418
    m_Localized: "Ses d\xFCzeylerini ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 ayarla. G\xF6rsel uyar\u0131lar
      g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr kal\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490419
    m_Localized: "Atamas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in bir kontrol se\xE7.
      Her tu\u015Fa yaln\u0131zca bir eylem atanabilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490420
    m_Localized: "Kontrollerini g\xF6rmek i\xE7in bir oyun kumandas\u0131 ba\u011Fla.
      Klavye ve fareyi kullanmaya devam edebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490421
    m_Localized: "Daha rahat oynamak i\xE7in kamera ve men\xFC hareketlerini azalt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490422
    m_Localized: "Halat gerginli\u011Fini renklerin yan\u0131nda simgelerle de g\xF6ster."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490423
    m_Localized: "Yaz\u0131 boyutu ve kamera hassasiyeti istedi\u011Fin zaman de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilebilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490424
    m_Localized: "Bu sekmenin varsay\u0131lan ayarlar\u0131 geri y\xFCklensin mi?
      Kariyer ilerlemesi korunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490425
    m_Localized: "T\xFCm ilerleme s\u0131f\u0131rlans\u0131n m\u0131? Krediler, ara\xE7lar,
      ekipman ve kay\u0131tl\u0131 d\xFCzenler silinir. Tercihler korunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490426
    m_Localized: "\u0130lerlemeyi s\u0131f\u0131rlamadan \xF6nce oturumdan ayr\u0131l."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490427
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC ayarlar\u0131 korunsun mu? Onaylamazsan 15 saniye
      sonra eski ayarlara d\xF6n\xFCl\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490428
    m_Localized: "Bu par\xE7alar yeni g\xF6vdeye uymuyor. Envanterinde kal\u0131rlar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490429
    m_Localized: "Bu par\xE7a sat\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131? Tekrar kullanmak i\xE7in
      yeniden sat\u0131n almal\u0131s\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490430
    m_Localized: "Tak\u0131l\u0131 ekipman\u0131 kaydet. \xD6nizlenen par\xE7alar
      kaydedilmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490431
    m_Localized: "Bu kay\u0131tl\u0131 d\xFCzen, tak\u0131l\u0131 ekipmanla de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilsin
      mi?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490432
    m_Localized: "S\xFCr\xFC\u015F, halat ba\u011Flama, vin\xE7 kullan\u0131m\u0131
      ve teslimat\u0131 dene. Kariyerin etkilenmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490433
    m_Localized: "E\u011Fitim atlanabilir ve Nas\u0131l Oynan\u0131r b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCnden
      tekrar oynanabilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490434
    m_Localized: "Ev sahibi ekip i\xE7in kurtarmay\u0131 se\xE7er."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490435
    m_Localized: "Birlikte oynamak i\xE7in ev sahibinin yerel IP adresini payla\u015F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490436
    m_Localized: "Oyun ba\u015Flat\u0131l\u0131yor. L\xFCtfen bekle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490437
    m_Localized: "Oyun ba\u015Flat\u0131lamad\u0131. Men\xFCye d\xF6n ve tekrar dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490438
    m_Localized: "\xD6deme almadan bu kurtarmadan ayr\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131? Sat\u0131n
      al\u0131nan ekipman ve kazan\u0131lan krediler korunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490439
    m_Localized: "Uygun lastikler, yeterli \xE7eki\u015F g\xFCc\xFC ve sa\u011Flam
      bir halat kullan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490440
    m_Localized: "Daha fazla a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k sabitlemeyi kolayla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r,
      ancak yoku\u015F yukar\u0131 \xE7ekmeyi zorla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490441
    m_Localized: "At\xF6lyenin yak\u0131n\u0131nda durarak garaj\u0131 a\xE7."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490442
    m_Localized: "Bu ayarlar\u0131 daha sonra de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490443
    m_Localized: "Kariyer ekipman\u0131n geri y\xFCklendi. Haz\u0131r olunca bir
      kurtarma se\xE7."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490444
    m_Localized: "Vinci yava\u015F\xE7a kullan ve halat\u0131 \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F
      y\xF6n\xFCnde tut."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490445
    m_Localized: "Bir tekerlek izde s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F. Yola do\u011Fru
      dengeli \xE7ek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490446
    m_Localized: "\u015Easi \xE7amura saplanm\u0131\u015F. Sa\u011Flam zeminden \xE7ek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490447
    m_Localized: "Otomobil k\u0131smen su alt\u0131nda. Kuru k\u0131y\u0131ya do\u011Fru
      \xE7ek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490448
    m_Localized: "Otomobil yolun alt\u0131na kaym\u0131\u015F. Rampa boyunca yukar\u0131
      \xE7ek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490449
    m_Localized: "Kar veya buz tekerlekleri s\u0131k\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rm\u0131\u015F.
      \u0130zler boyunca \xE7ek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490450
    m_Localized: "Tekerlekler kuma g\xF6m\xFClm\xFC\u015F. Sa\u011Flam zeminden \xE7ek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490451
    m_Localized: "Motor veya frenler ar\u0131zal\u0131. Otomobili yava\u015F\xE7a
      kurtar, sonra \xE7ek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490452
    m_Localized: "Otomobil kuru kanalda s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F. \xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F
      rampas\u0131n\u0131 kullan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490453
    m_Localized: "Otomobili kurtar ve \u015Furaya teslim et:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490454
    m_Localized: "Biten kurtarmalar tekrar oynamak i\xE7in burada g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490455
    m_Localized: "Sat\u0131n Al ve Tak se\xE7ene\u011Fini se\xE7ene kadar para harcanmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490456
    m_Localized: "Par\xE7a takmadan \xF6nce araca sahip olmal\u0131s\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490457
    m_Localized: "Kariyer okunamad\u0131. As\u0131l kay\u0131t korundu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490458
    m_Localized: "Bu tu\u015F men\xFCler veya kamera i\xE7in ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490459
    m_Localized: Gerekli
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490460
    m_Localized: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490461
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131t bekleniyor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490462
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131t kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490463
    m_Localized: Tavsiye edilen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490464
    m_Localized: Temel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490465
    m_Localized: "\u0130lk kurtarma"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490466
    m_Localized: "Halat kopmas\u0131 yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490467
    m_Localized: "\u0130ade edildi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490468
    m_Localized: "Tak\u0131ld\u0131 ve kaydedildi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490469
    m_Localized: "Par\xE7a sat\u0131ld\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490470
    m_Localized: "Dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490471
    m_Localized: Uzunluk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490472
    m_Localized: "Lastik t\xFCr\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490473
    m_Localized: "D\xF6rt tekerlek seti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490474
    m_Localized: "Kopma e\u015Fi\u011Fi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490475
    m_Localized: "G\xFC\xE7lendirilmi\u015F halat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490476
    m_Localized: Profesyonel halat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490477
    m_Localized: "Geli\u015Ftirilmi\u015F vin\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490478
    m_Localized: "Profesyonel vin\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490479
    m_Localized: Motor seviyesi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490480
    m_Localized: "A\u011F\u0131r alp"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490481
    m_Localized: Motor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490482
    m_Localized: "\xC7amurluklar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490483
    m_Localized: Tekerlekler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490484
    m_Localized: "\xD6n tampon"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490485
    m_Localized: Tavan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490486
    m_Localized: Emme sistemi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490487
    m_Localized: Egzoz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490488
    m_Localized: Standart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490489
    m_Localized: Standart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490490
    m_Localized: Sonraki sekme
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490491
    m_Localized: "Se\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490492
    m_Localized: Gezin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490493
    m_Localized: Gezin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490494
    m_Localized: "H\u0131zlan"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490495
    m_Localized: "Halat\u0131 \xE7\xF6z"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490496
    m_Localized: "\xC7eki\u015F g\xFCc\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490497
    m_Localized: "Yerden y\xFCkseklik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490498
    m_Localized: Kar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490499
    m_Localized: Kum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490500
    m_Localized: "\xC7amur"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490501
    m_Localized: "En k\u0131sa uzunluk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490502
    m_Localized: En uzun uzunluk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490503
    m_Localized: "{0}\n\nBu sekmenin varsay\u0131lan ayarlar\u0131 geri y\xFCklensin
      mi? Kariyer ilerlemesi korunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490504
    m_Localized: "{0}\n\nAtamas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in bir kontrol
      se\xE7. Her tu\u015Fa yaln\u0131zca bir eylem atanabilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490505
    m_Localized: "{0}\nBir tu\u015Fa bas. Esc iptal eder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490506
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC ayarlar\u0131 korunsun mu? Onaylamazsan 15 saniye
      sonra eski ayarlara d\xF6n\xFCl\xFCr.\nS\xFCre: {0} s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490507
    m_Localized: "{0}\n\nBu kay\u0131tl\u0131 d\xFCzen, tak\u0131l\u0131 ekipmanla
      de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilsin mi?\nTak\u0131l\u0131 ekipman\u0131 kaydet. \xD6nizlenen
      par\xE7alar kaydedilmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490508
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Kaydedildi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490509
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Tak\u0131ld\u0131 ve kaydedildi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490510
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Standart"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490511
    m_Localized: "Tak\u0131l\u0131 \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490512
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 d\xFCzenler \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490513
    m_Localized: "Teslimat \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490514
    m_Localized: 'Dil: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490515
    m_Localized: "Bir kurtarma se\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490516
    m_Localized: "Sat {0} \xB7 {1} CR?\nBu par\xE7a sat\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131? Tekrar
      kullanmak i\xE7in yeniden sat\u0131n almal\u0131s\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490517
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Halat\u0131 sar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490518
    m_Localized: "{0} / {1} \xB7 H\u0131zlan / Geri git"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490519
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 H\u0131zlan / Geri git\n{1} \xB7 Direksiyon\nFren"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14491554144502
    m_Localized: "Performans ayr\u0131nt\u0131y\u0131 azalt\u0131r. Kalite daha \xE7ok
      ayr\u0131nt\u0131 korur. \xD6nizlemek i\xE7in uygula."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14491554144503
    m_Localized: "Dikey kamera hareketini tersine \xE7evirir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14491554144504
    m_Localized: "Duruma g\xF6re ipu\xE7lar\u0131 g\xF6sterir. Hedefler ve halat
      uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr kal\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14491554144505
    m_Localized: "\u0130pu\xE7lar\u0131 \xF6\u011Frenmeyi kolayla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r.
      \u0130lerlemeyi S\u0131f\u0131rla kariyeri siler ve tercihleri korur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14491554144506
    m_Localized: "Vin\xE7 y\xFCk alt\u0131nda yava\u015Flar ve s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131nda
      durur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14491554144507
    m_Localized: "Bu par\xE7a yaln\u0131zca g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFC de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
